Adhemerval Zanella 在 sparc 上 O_NDELAY 与 O_NONBLOCK 内核与 glibc 取值不一致的讨论中转引 Sergei Trofimovich 的考古发现："sparc32 originally defined O_NDELAY as 0x0004, but it has changed it to 0x0004 | O_NONBLOCK on 2.1.29"（Trofimovich 观察这是为了与 SunOS 兼容——"Solaris11 O_NDELAY is 0x4 on both 32 and 64 bits"），并认为根因是 "FIONBIO historical inconsistency over different system that Linux originally tried to accommodate"。Zanella 另援引 glibc 手册 "This is an obsolete name for @code{O_NONBLOCK}, provided for compatibility with BSD. It is not defined by the POSIX.1 standard."——即 glibc 手册自身把 O_NDELAY 标注为 BSD 兼容别名；eventlet 与 libuv 两个用户态项目依赖该等式成立。

